    "updated_at": "2023-01-12T08:42:53Z",
    "body": "C's navigable makes sense to me. It cannot hold a navigable of a different type anyway.\r\n\r\nFor the other two using the same term makes some sense. Historically we called them \"nested\" but I wouldn't mind switching to \"child\" as that's closer to the tree terminology we already use in various places.",
