    "created_at": "2023-01-13T08:58:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-01-13T08:58:04Z",
    "body": "Additional proposals: \"owned navigable\", \"hosted navigable\" and \"tenant navigable\".\r\nI'm less into \"navigable\" as is because it can be ambiguous with the hosting navigable of the element's document's window or so",
